  "description": "Embed the API Test Spark React SPA into any .NET 10 Minimal API project with a\n      single MapApiTestSpark() call. Autodiscovers OpenAPI v3 endpoints and renders an interactive\n      test harness at /api-test-spark/. Features: collapsible accordion endpoint groups derived from\n      OpenAPI tags, full response code documentation with expandable schemas, operationId display,\n      schema constraint and default-value surfacing, full markdown rendering of OpenAPI descriptions,\n      sortable response tables, editable object forms, curl command generation, API Doc Builder for\n      generating front-end developer agent documentation, draggable debug panel, and Azure Application\n      Insights integration. Zero configuration required — just add MapApiTestSpark().",
